  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Do mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> cắt mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> theo giao tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math>; cắt mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> theo giao tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, mà hai mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> song song nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mo>∥</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tương tự có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mo>∥</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math> lần lượt là tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math>. Dễ dàng có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình của hai hình thang <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/ec5597580aa4160f5daf520f1a67946c0bedd7a1479c35c36778aa6b4462600f.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
